  "instructions": [
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add cumin seeds and let them sizzle for 1 minute.",
    "Add onion and cook until it is translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add iceberg lettuce and cook until it is wilted, about 5 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Warm naan breads in the oven or in a dry skillet.",
    "Assemble the braise by placing a piece of naan on a plate, followed by a portion of the wilted lettuce mixture, and finishing with a dollop of vegan yogurt.",
    "Garnish with lemon juice and serve immediately."
